          "expected": "The connection request is sent via FRMCS, overriding the stored GSM-R preference."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TC-ETC-005-03",
      "title": "Radio system selection priority: Stored preference used when no higher priority exists",
      "covers": [
        "ETC-005"
      ],
      "type": "Normal",
      "priority": "Orta",
      "preconditions": "The OBU is equipped with both GSM-R and FRMCS radio systems. No trackside order specifying a radio system is active. The driver has not made a specific single-radio choice for this session (or the choice is not applicable/overridden by context, e.g., not at Start of Mission or choice not set). The stored Radio Network information specifies GSM-R as the preferred radio system.",
