          "expected": "The OBU reports or stores FRMCS as the radio system used for the successful connection."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TC-ETC-006-02",
      "title": "Memorization update when radio system changes between sessions",
      "covers": [
        "ETC-006"
      ],
      "type": "Normal",
      "priority": "Orta",
      "preconditions": "The OBU is equipped with both GSM-R and FRMCS radio systems. A previous session was established using GSM-R. A new session is triggered and successfully established using FRMCS.",
      "test_inputs": "New session establishment via FRMCS after a previous GSM-R session.",
      "assumptions": "The OBU updates the memorized radio system upon each successful session establishment.",
